; With no annotated posting the first posting is the top one, so the
; cost side is 1 A and the doubled remainder 2 A does not round away.
; Compare the same postings in the other order in
; implicit-exchange-accepted.test.

commodity B
    format 1000.00 B

2024/01/01 Same signs, top posting last
    Assets:Tiny:Y    0.001 B
    Assets:Tiny:X       1 A

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 11:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 9-11:
> 2024/01/01 Same signs, top posting last
>     Assets:Tiny:Y    0.001 B
>     Assets:Tiny:X       1 A
Unbalanced remainder is:
                 2 A
Amount to balance against:
                 2 A
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
